```
{
  "d1": {
    "dialogue_id": "d1",
    "turns": [
      {
        "sys": "Hello.",
        "usr": "Book a taxi.",
        "dialog_act": {"BookTaxi": [["departure", "Downtown"]]},
        "state": {}
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
for all three files. Then clone, patch, install, run (with correct PYTHONPATH), and output only the required JSON.

